@startgantt
' =====================================================================
'  Planification du projet - stage du 15 fevrier au 15 aout 2026
' =====================================================================
skinparam defaultFontName Verdana
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

printscale weekly
Project starts the 15th of february 2026
saturday are closed
sunday are closed

-- Cadrage --
[Etude prealable et analyse des besoins] as [S0] lasts 15 days
[S0] is colored in #DCE7F5
[Mise en place de l environnement] as [S0b] lasts 5 days
[S0b] starts at [S0]'s end
[S0b] is colored in #DCE7F5

-- Sprints de developpement --
[Sprint 1 : identites, acces et securite] as [S1] lasts 20 days
[S1] starts at [S0b]'s end
[S1] is colored in #E8F1FB
[Sprint 2 : referentiel de flotte et equipements] as [S2] lasts 20 days
[S2] starts at [S1]'s end
[S2] is colored in #E8F1FB
[Sprint 3 : demande, devis, mission et suivi] as [S3] lasts 20 days
[S3] starts at [S2]'s end
[S3] is colored in #E8F1FB
[Sprint 4 : maintenance curative et predictive] as [S4] lasts 20 days
[S4] starts at [S3]'s end
[S4] is colored in #E8F1FB
[Sprint 5 : facturation, alertes et journal metier] as [S5] lasts 15 days
[S5] starts at [S4]'s end
[S5] is colored in #E8F1FB
[Sprint 6 : collaboration et aide a la decision] as [S6] lasts 15 days
[S6] starts at [S5]'s end
[S6] is colored in #E8F1FB

-- Cloture --
[Recette et mise en production] as [S7] lasts 8 days
[S7] starts at [S6]'s end
[S7] is colored in #DCE7F5
[Redaction du rapport] as [R] lasts 45 days
[R] starts at [S4]'s start
[R] is colored in #F5E9DC

[Livraison finale] happens at [S7]'s end

@endgantt
